{"name": "The Lonesome Guild", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A TALE OF TOGETHERNESS IN A WORLD APART\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/9bedb1edd267f8dac163ab7e4f9de63d.poster.avif?t=1782125939\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/9bedb1edd267f8dac163ab7e4f9de63d.webm?t=1782125939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/9bedb1edd267f8dac163ab7e4f9de63d.mp4?t=1782125939\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a failed ritual to elevate the world\u2019s Champions and grant them miracles capable of improving the world, a mist of loneliness and despair sweeps the land of Etere...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A glimmer of hope materialises\u00a0as\u00a0Ghost, a spirit who wakes to find they hold no memories.\u00a0It\u2019s\u00a0time to embark on a heroic adventure and gather those who can restore balance and help you discover your past in this charming and emotional tale.\u00a0It\u2019s\u00a0time to\u00a0start a new chapter together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/726f595f6d249b88a65f50d8fe888160.poster.avif?t=1782125939\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/726f595f6d249b88a65f50d8fe888160.webm?t=1782125939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/726f595f6d249b88a65f50d8fe888160.mp4?t=1782125939\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JOURNEY TO CATHARSIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relationships are the heart and soul of The Lonesome Guild \u2013\u00a0it\u2019s\u00a0a\u00a0party, literally.\u00a0And a\u00a0party can only be strong if each member is strong too \u2013\u00a0build deep bonds and help your new friends find\u00a0their inner strength\u00a0through the conflicts they face.\u00a0Your\u00a0ragtag group of\u00a06\u00a0unlikely friends\u00a0will bring\u00a0their own story and struggles. Switch\u00a0seamlessly\u00a0between them\u00a0in battle and exploration, unlock side quests\u00a0and new abilities, and\u00a0have\u00a0heartfelt chats by the campfire.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/bb1684d88068a932fdede201877d741e.poster.avif?t=1782125939\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/bb1684d88068a932fdede201877d741e.webm?t=1782125939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/bb1684d88068a932fdede201877d741e.mp4?t=1782125939\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIGHTS THAT KEEP YOU ON YOUR TOES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ghost \u2018joins\u2019 with our heroes in battle, making them stronger. Test your might in intense battles where you can switch between characters whenever you fancy and ambush enemies with clever combos. Build your dream team to match your playstyle, create cool and unique synergies between heroes, and fight your way through Etere together.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/b0e296b199df10897e8e2cdd2c0aa34f.poster.avif?t=1782125939\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/b0e296b199df10897e8e2cdd2c0aa34f.webm?t=1782125939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/b0e296b199df10897e8e2cdd2c0aa34f.mp4?t=1782125939\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A WORLD WORTH FIGHTING FOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Etere is an enchanted hand-painted world full of charm and secrets, inhabited by ancient cultures and living legends across five distinct regions. Solve puzzles and unearth old secrets as a team to overcome obstacles nobody could face alone. You can find many shiny objects \u2013 gifts for your friends, artifacts to help, and loot that enhance your party\u2019s fighting prowess.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world might be lonely, but you don\u2019t have to be.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/c5e6a453f66efe6389ee6156acf98572.poster.avif?t=1782125939\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/c5e6a453f66efe6389ee6156acf98572.webm?t=1782125939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/c5e6a453f66efe6389ee6156acf98572.mp4?t=1782125939\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "The world of\u00a0Etere\u00a0was shattered after the discovery of a terrifying truth.\u00a0Play as Ghost\u00a0to\u00a0gather the Champions\u00a0and\u00a0restore balance to a world in conflict in this action RPG that takes you on an epic journey to fulfil\u00a0Etere\u2019s\u00a0destiny.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/header.jpg?t=1782125939", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action-Adventure", "Story Rich", "Lore-Rich", "Fantasy", "RPG", "Party-Based RPG"], "developers": "Tiny Bull Studios", "publishers": "Tiny Bull Studios", "release_date": "Oct 23, 2025", "price": "$24.99", "appid": "1486450", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/skIFzHYz5Qo", "first_seen": 1748383200.0, "review_rank": 1635}